                  {
                     "text" : "raspberrypi openssl/libcurl issue - sometimes gets CURLE_RECV_ERROR talking google ssl under valgrind",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "If not with valgrind - works fine.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "If not on raspberrypi works fine. Other https sites work fine.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "Simple workaround for now, but my guess is this is a protocol issie and will get fixed or get worse.",
